<title>USA: U.S. cash soymeal - Trade grinds to virtual halt.</title>
<headline>U.S. cash soymeal - Trade grinds to virtual halt.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-12-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Soybean meal basis offers were steady with trade slowing to a virtual standstill ahead of Wednesday's New Year holiday.</p>
<p>Dealers noted that buyers tended to go heavily long ahead of the Christmas/New Year period and spend the first few days of January running down stocks.</p>
<p>&quot;I think it will be a week or so before the market really gets back on its feet,&quot; one soymeal broker said.</p>
<p>The basis continued to have a weak tone with isolated strength often linked to plant breakdowns.</p>
